hadiths[47]{hadithnumber,text}:
"104","[AI-translation] Musab bin Sa'd se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Ibn Amir ke paas iyadat ko aaye kyunke Ibn Amir beemar thay. Ibn Amir ne kaha ke Ae Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhu) tum mere liye dua nahi kartay? Unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala baghair taharat ke namaz qabool nahi karta aur us maal-e-ghaneemat mein se diye gaye sadqay ko bhi qabool nahi karta jo taqseem se pehle ura liya jaye aur tum to Basra ke haakim reh chukay ho. (Muslim: 1/140). Baab: Neend se uth kar bartan mein daalnay se pehle haath dhona. (Muslim mein hai ke namaz qabool nahi hoti; murad ye hai ke tum ghulool se mehfooz nahi.)"
"105","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi neend se jagay to apna haath bartan mein daalnay se pehle teen baar dhoye is liye ke us ko nahi maloom ke us ka haath raat ko kahan raha. (Muslim: 1/160). Baab: Rastay aur saayon mein qaza-e-haajat se mumaniat."
"106","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum laanat ke do kaamon se bacho, yani jin ki wajah se log tum par laanat karein. Logon ne kaha ke wo laanat ke do kaam kaun se hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik to raah mein, jahan se log aatay jatay hon, pakhana karna aur doosri saya daar jagah, jahan log baith kar aaram kar letay hon, pakhana karna. In donon kaamon se logon ko takleef ho gi aur wo bura kahein ge laanat karein ge. (Muslim: 1/156). Baab: Qaza-e-haajat ke liye pardah."
"107","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Jafar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe aik dafa Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sawaari par apne peechay bitha liya, phir mere kaan mein aik baat kahi wo baat kisi se bayan na karun ga aur Aap ko haajat ke waqt teelay ki ya khajoor ke darakhton ki aar pasand thi, taake satr ko koi na dekhay. Ibn Asma ne aik hadees mein haish-e-nakhl ki bajaye hait-e-nakhl kaha. (Muslim). (Muslim mein hai ke namaz qabool nahi hoti; takhalli se murad tanhayi mein qaza-e-haajat hai.)"
"108","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bait-ul-khala mein daakhil hotay to kehtay ke Ae Allah! Main panah maangta hun Teri, napaak shaitanon aur shaitanniyon se ya paleedi ya nijasaton se ya shayateen aur maasi se. (Muslim: 1/195). Baab: Qibla ki taraf peshaab ya pakhana na karo."
"109","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum pakhanay ko jao to peshaab ya pakhana karnay mein qibla ki taraf munh na karo na peeth karo, balke mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf munh karo. Is se murad un ilaqon ke log hain jin ka qibla shumal ya junoob ki simt ho. Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ham Shaam ke mulk mein aaye aur dekha to latrinein qibla ki taraf bani hui hain, ham un par se munh pher letay thay aur Allah Taala se istighfar kartay thay. (Muslim: 1/154). Baab: Imaraton mein is ki rukhsat."
"110","[AI-translation] Wasi bin Hibban kehtay hain ke main masjid mein namaz padh raha tha aur Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) apni peeth qibla ki taraf lagaye hue baithay thay. Jab main namaz padh chuka to aik taraf se un ke paas mura. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke log kehtay hain ke jab haajat ko baitho to qibla aur Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf munh na karo. Aik dafa jab main chhat par charha to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko do eenton par qaza-e-haajat ke liye Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye hue baithay dekha, yani jab Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf munh ho ga to qibla ki taraf peeth ho gi. (Muslim: 1/155). Baab: Thehray hue pani mein peshaab phir us se ghusl ki mumaniat."
"111","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi thehray hue pani mein peshaab na karay, aur ye bhi na karay ke peshaab kar ke phir usi pani se ghusl karay. Aik aur riwayat mein hai ke tu aisa mat kar ke thamay hue pani mein peshaab karay jo behta nahi hai aur phir usi pani se ghusl karay. (Muslim: 1/162)"
"112","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) do qabron par se guzray to farmaya ke in donon qabr walon par azaab ho raha hai aur kuch baray gunah par nahi. Aik to un mein se chughal khori karta tha, yani aik ki baat doosray se karna aur larai ke liye, aur doosra apne peshaab se bachnay mein ehtiyat na karta. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor ki hari tehni mangwayi aur cheer kar us ko do kiya aur har aik qabr par aik aik gaar di aur farmaya ke shayad jab tak ye tehniyan na sookhein us waqt tak un ka azaab halka ho jaye. (Muslim: 1/166). Baab: Daayein haath se istinja ki mumaniat. (Aseeb se murad khajoor ki daali hai.)"
"113","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Qatada apne walid Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke koi tum mein se apna zakar peshaab karnay mein daahnay haath se na thaamay aur na pakhana ke baad daahnay haath se istinja karay aur na bartan mein phoonk maaray. (Muslim: 1/155). Baab: Pakhana ke baad pani se istinja."
"114","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik baagh ke andar gaye aur Aap ke peechay aik larka gaya, us ke paas aik lota tha, wo larka ham mein sab se chota tha. Us ne lota aik bairi ke paas rakh diya aur phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni haajat se farigh hue aur pani se istinja kar ke bahar niklay. (Muslim: 1/156). Baab: Taq dheloon se istinja. (Mizada se murad wuzu ka bartan hai; sidra bairi ka darakht hai.)"
"115","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi pakhana ki jagah ko dheloon se saaf karay to taq dheloon se saaf karay aur jab tum mein se koi wuzu karay to naak mein pani daalay phir naak jhaaray. (Muslim: 1/146). Baab: Patharon se istinja aur gobar aur haddi se mumaniat."
"116","[AI-translation] Salman (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Un se poocha gaya ke tumharay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tum ko har aik baat sikhayi. Yahan tak ke pakhana aur peshaab ki bhi taleem di, unhon ne kaha haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein qibla ki taraf munh kar ke peshaab aur pakhana karnay se mana kiya aur is baat se bhi mana kiya ke daahnay haath se ya teen se kam patharon se ya gobar aur haddi se istinja karein. (Muslim: 1/154)"
"117","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) ki kisi londi ko aik bakri sadqa mein di gayi thi, wo mar gayi. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko para hua dekha to farmaya ke tum ne us ki khaal kyun na utaar li? Rang kar kaam mein laatay. To logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo murdaar thi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke murdaar ka khana haraam hai. (Muslim: 1/190). Baab: Jab khaal rang li jaye to paak ho gayi. (Ihaab se murad dabaghat se pehle ki khaal hai.)"
"118","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Abu Habib se riwayat hai ke Abul Khair ne un se bayan kiya ke main ne Ibn Wala Sabai ko aik posteen pehnay dekha. Main ne us ko chhua, unhon ne kaha ke Ibn Wala kyun chhootay ho, kya us ko najis jantay ho? Main ne Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke ham maghrib ke mulk mein rehtay hain wahan barbar ke kafir aur aatish parast bohat hain wo maindha zabah kar ke laatay hain. Ham to un ka zabah kiya hua janwar nahi khatay aur mashkein laatay hain, un mein charbi daal kar. Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke khaal rangnay se paak ho jati hai, yani khaal rangnay se paak ho jati hai agarchay kafir ne rangi ho. (Muslim: 1/191). Baab: Jab kutta bartan mein munh daalay to usay saat baar dhoye. (Siqa mashk hai; wadak se murad charbi hai.)"
"119","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kutton ko maar daalnay ka hukm kiya. Phir farmaya ke in logon aur kutton ka kya haal hai? Phir shikaar ke liye aur maweshiyon ki hifazat ke liye kutta paalnay ki ijazat di, yani bakriyon ki hifazat ke liye, aur farmaya ke jab kutta bartan mein munh daal kar piye to us ko saat baar dho aur aathwin baar mitti se maanjho. Aur Yahya bin Sa'id ki riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shikaar, bakriyon aur khaiti ki hifazat ke liye kuttay ki ijazat di. (Muslim: 1/162). Baab: Wuzu ki fazilat."
"120","[AI-translation] Abu Malik Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Taharat aadhay iman ke barabar hai aur Alhamdulillah tarazu ko bhar de ga, yani is qadar us ka sawab azeem hai ke aamaal taulnay ka tarazu us ke ajar se bhar jaye ga, aur SubhanAllah aur Alhamdulillah donon aasmanon aur zameen ke beech ki jagah ko bhar dein ge aur namaz noor hai aur sadqa daleel hai aur sabr roshni hai aur Quran tere liye daleel ho ga ya tere khilaf daleel ho ga, agar Quran par amal ho ga to daleel ban jaye ga warna wabaal ban jaye ga. Har aik aadmi, bhala ho ya bura, subah ko uthta hai ya to apne aap ko, naik kaam kar ke Allah ke azaab se, azaad karta hai ya, buray kaam kar ke, apne aap ko tabah karta hai. (Muslim: 1/140)"
"121","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab banda Musalman ya momin, ye shak hai rawi ka, wuzu karta hai aur munh dhota hai to us ke munh se wo sab gunah, sagheera, nikal jatay hain jo us ne aankhon se kiye. Pani ke saath ya aakhri qatra ke saath, jo munh se girta hai ye bhi shak hai rawi ka. Phir jab haath dhota hai to us ke haathon mein se har aik gunah jo haath se kiya tha, pani ke saath ya aakhri qatra ke saath nikal jata hai. Phir jab paon dhota hai to har aik gunah jis ko us ne paon se chal kar kiya tha, pani ke saath ya aakhri qatra ke saath nikal jata hai yahan tak ke sab gunaahon se paak saaf ho kar nikalta hai. (Muslim: 1/148). Baab: Wuzu ke waqt miswaak."
"122","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo aik raat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas rahay to pichli raat ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) uthay aur bahar nikal kar aasmaan ki taraf dekha. Phir ye aayat padhi jo Surah Aal-e-Imran mein hai: Beshak aasmanon aur zameen ki paidaish mein aur raat din ke badalnay mein aqal walon ke liye nishaniyan hain, se Hamein aag ke azaab se bacha tak. Phir laut kar andar aaye aur miswaak ki aur wuzu kiya aur kharay ho kar namaz padhi. Phir lait gaye phir uthay aur bahar niklay aur aasmaan ki taraf dekha aur yehi aayat padhi. Phir laut kar andar aaye aur miswaak ki aur wuzu kiya aur phir kharay ho kar namaz padhi. (Muslim: 1/152). (Muslim mein watawazza hai.)"
"123","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab ghar mein aatay to pehle miswaak kartay. (Muslim: 1/152). Baab: Taharat aur ghair mein daayein taraf se shuru karna."
"124","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) taharat mein, kanghi karnay mein, joota pehnnay mein daahni taraf ko bohat pasand kartay thay. (Muslim: 1/155-156). Baab: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke wuzu ki sifat. (Tarajjul se murad baal sanwarna hai.)"
"125","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid bin Aasim Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo sahabi thay, ke un se logon ne kaha ke hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki tarah wuzu kar ke batlaiye. Chunanche unhon ne aik bartan, pani ka, mangwaya, us ko jhuka kar pehle donon haathon par pani daala. Is se maloom hua ke wuzu shuru kartay waqt donon haathon ka ungliyon samet dhona mustahab hai, pani mein haath daalnay se pehle. Aur unhein teen baar dhoya. Phir haath bartan ke andar daala aur bahar nikala aur aik hi challu se kulli ki aur naak mein pani daala. Phir teen baar aisay hi kiya. Phir haath daala aur bahar nikala aur munh ko teen baar dhoya, Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai ke donon challu mila kar pani liya aur teen baar munh dhoya. Phir bartan mein haath daala aur bahar nikala aur apne donon haath kuhniyon tak do do baar dhoye. Phir bartan mein haath daala aur bahar nikala aur sar par masah kiya, pehle donon haathon ko saamnay se peechay le gaye phir peechay se aagay ki taraf le aaye, yani peshani tak wapas laaye. Phir donon paon takhnon samet dhoye. Us ke baad kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) isi tarah wuzu kiya kartay thay. (Muslim). (Akfaa se murad jhukana hai.)"
"126","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs wuzu karay to naak mein pani daalay phir naak jhaaray. (Muslim: 1/146)"
"127","[AI-translation] Nuaim bin Abdullah Mujmir se riwayat hai ke main ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ko dekha ke wuzu kartay hue unhon ne munh dhoya to us ko poora dhoya. Phir daahna haath dhoya yahan tak ke baazu ka aik hissa bhi dhoya. Phir baayan haath dhoya yahan tak ke baazu ka aik hissa bhi dhoya. Phir sar ka masah kiya. Phir seedha paon dhoya to pindli ka bhi aik hissa dhoya. Phir baayan paon dhoya yahan tak ke pindli ka bhi aik hissa dhoya. Phir kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisa hi wuzu kartay hue dekha hai aur kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qayamat ke din poora wuzu karnay ki wajah se tumhari peshaniyan aur haath paon safed, noorani, hon ge. Lihaza tum mein se jo koi apni chamak ko barhana chahay to barhaye, yani apne aaza ko khoob aagay tak dhoye. (Muslim: 1/149). (Ashraa se murad ghusl ko aagay barhana hai; Hafiz Ibn Hajar ne tarjeeh di ke faman istataa wala jumla Abu Huraira ka kalaam hai.)"
"128","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) qabristan mein tashreef laaye to farmaya: Salam hai tum par ye ghar hai Musalmanon ka aur Allah ne chaha to ham bhi tum se milnay walay hain. Meri aarzu hai ke ham apne bhaiyon ko dekhein. Is hadees se maloom hua ke naik baat ki aarzu karna durust hai jaisay ulama aur fuzala se milnay ki. Sahaba (raziyallahu anhum) ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya ham Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke bhai nahi hain? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum to mere ashaab ho aur bhai hamaray wo log hain jo abhi duniya mein nahi aaye. Sahaba ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap apni ummat ke un logon ko kaisay pehchanein ge jin ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dekha hi nahi? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya bhala tum mein se kisi ke safed peshani, safed haath paon walay ghoray siyah mushki ghoron mein mil jayein, to wo apne ghoray nahi pehchanay ga? Sahaba ne arz kiya ke beshak wo to pehchan le ga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qayamat ke din wuzu ki wajah se meri ummat ke log safed munh aur safed haath paon rakhtay hon ge aur hauz-e-kausar par main un ka pesh khaima hun ga. Khabardar raho ke baaz log mere hauz par se hataye jayein ge jaisay bhatka hua oont hankaya jata hai. Main un ko pukarun ga aao aao. Us waqt kaha jaye ga ke in logon ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad radd o badal kar liya tha, ya un ki haalat badal gayi thi, bidat aur zulm mein giraftar ho gaye thay. Tab main kahun ga ke jao door ho jao. Jao door ho jao. (Muslim: 1/150). (Duhm buhm se murad siyah ghore hain; Muslim mein bal aur yaum-ul-qiyama nahi hain.)"
"129","[AI-translation] Humran se riwayat hai jo Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) ke azaad kardah ghulam thay, unhon ne kaha ke Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) ne wuzu ka pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya to pehle donon haath kalaiyon tak teen baar dhoye, phir kulli ki aur naak mein pani daala. Phir teen baar munh dhoya, phir daahna haath dhoya kuhni tak phir teen baar baayan haath dhoya phir masah kiya sar par. Phir daahna paon dhoya teen baar phir baayan paon dhoya teen baar. Us ke baad kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne isi tarah wuzu kiya jaisay main ne ab wuzu kiya. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs mere wuzu ki tarah wuzu karay phir kharay ho kar do rakatein padhay aur un, ke padhnay, mein aur kisi khayal mein gharq na ho to us ke aglay gunah bakhsh diye jayein ge. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke hamaray ulama kehtay thay ke ye wuzu sab wuzuon mein se poora hai jo namaz ke liye kiya jaye. (Muslim: 1/141). (Wuzu se murad wuzu ka pani hai; mazmaza se murad kulli hai.)"
"130","[AI-translation] Humran se riwayat hai ke Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mukammal wuzu kiya jaisa ke Allah Taala ne usay hukm diya hai, to farz namazein us ke un tamam gunaahon ka kaffara ban jayein gi jo un namazon ke darmiyan hon ge. (Muslim: 1/143)"
"131","[AI-translation] Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke jo shakhs namaz ke liye poora wuzu karay, phir farz namaz ke liye masjid ko chalay aur logon ke saath ya jamaat se ya masjid mein namaz padhay, to Allah Taala us ke gunah bakhsh de ga. (Muslim: 1/144). Baab: Sakhti mein poora wuzu karna."
"132","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein wo baatein na batlaun ke jin se gunah mit jayein, yani maaf ho jayein ya likhnay walon ke daftar se mit jayein, aur jannat mein darjay buland hon? Logon ne kaha ke kyun nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool! Batlaiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wuzu ka poora, achi tarah, karna sakhti mein, jaisay sardi ki shiddat mein ya beemari mein, aur masjidon ki taraf qadmon ka bohat zyada hona, is tarah ke ghar masjid se door ho aur baar baar jaye, aur aik namaz ke baad doosri namaz ka intezar karna. Yehi ribaat hai, yani nafs ka rokna ibadat ke liye. (Muslim: 1/151). Baab: Zewar wahan tak jahan tak wuzu pahunche."
"133","[AI-translation] Abu Hazim se riwayat hai ke main Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke peechay tha, wo namaz ke liye wuzu kar rahay thay aur apne haath ko itna lamba kar ke dhotay thay, yahan tak ke baghal tak dhotay thay. Main ne kaha ke Ae Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ye kaisa wuzu hai? To unhon ne kaha: Ae Farrukh ki aulad, Farrukh Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke aik betay ka naam hai, jis ki aulad mein Ajam ke log hain aur Abu Hazim bhi Ajami thay, tum yahan maujood ho? Agar main janta ke tum yahan maujood ho to main is tarah wuzu na karta. Main ne apne dost, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke qayamat ke din momin ko wahan tak zewar pehnaya jaye ga, jahan tak us ka wuzu pahunchta ho ga. (Muslim)"
"134","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya ke aik shakhs ne wuzu kiya aur nakhun barabar apne paon mein kisi jagah ko sookha chhor diya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko dekha to farmaya ke ja aur achi tarah wuzu kar ke aa. Chunanche wo laut gaya, phir aa kar namaz padhi. (Muslim: 1/148). Baab: Ghusl aur wuzu mein kitna pani kaafi hai."
"135","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik mudd se wuzu kartay aur aik sa' se le kar paanch mudd tak ghusl kartay thay. Aik sa' dhai kilo ka hota hai aur mudd aik sa' ka chautha hissa hai. (Muslim: 1/177). Baab: Mozaon par masah."
"136","[AI-translation] (Is mukhtasar ke is taba mein is number ka Arabi matn nahi hai; Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees upar hadees 135 ke aakhir mein aayi hai: Unhon ne peshaab kiya, phir wuzu kiya aur apne donon mozon par masah kiya tha, aur un ka Islam Surah Maida ke naazil honay ke baad hua tha.)"
"137","[AI-translation] Abu Wail (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) peshaab ke muamla mein nihayat sakhti kartay thay hatta ke sheeshi mein peshaab kiya kartay thay aur kehtay thay ke Bani Israeel mein jab kisi ke badan ko peshaab lag jata to wo, qainchiyon se, khaal katarta tha. Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main chahta hun ke Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) aisi sakhti na kartay to behtar tha, kyunke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath chal raha tha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik qaum ke ghooray, yani koray karkat ki jagah, par aaye aur deewar ke peechay Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay hue jis tarah tum mein se koi khara hota hai, phir peshaab kiya. Main door hata to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ishara farmaya ke mere paas aa, yahan tak ke main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki airiyon ke paas khara raha, jab tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) peshaab se farigh na hue. Aik riwayat mein itna zyada hai ke phir wuzu kiya aur donon mozon par masah kiya. (Muslim: 1/157). (Muslim mein qaum ka lafz is riwayat mein nahi, doosri riwayat mein hai.)"
"138","[AI-translation] Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik safar mein tha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne daryaft farmaya ke kya tumharay paas pani hai? Main ne kaha ji haan hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawaari par se utray aur chalay yahan tak ke andheri raat mein nazron se chhup gaye. Phir laut kar aaye to main ne dole se pani daala. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne munh dhoya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne oon ka jubba pehan rakha tha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye haath aasteenon se bahar nikalna mushkil ho gaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne neechay se haathon ko bahar nikaal kar dhoya aur sar par masah kiya. Phir main, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mozay utarnay ke liye jhuka, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Rehnay do. Main ne un ko taharat par pehna hai aur un donon par bhi masah kiya. (Muslim)"
"139","[AI-translation] Shuraih bin Hani se riwayat hai ke main Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas, un se mozon par masah ke baaray mein poochnay aaya to unhon ne kaha ke tum Abu Talib ke betay, yani Ali (raziyallahu anhu), se poocho, is liye ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar kiya kartay thay. Ham ne un se poocha to unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne musafir ke liye masah ki muddat teen din teen raat muqarrar farmayi aur muqeem ke liye aik din raat. (Muslim: 1/160). Baab: Peshani aur amama par masah."
"140","[AI-translation] Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar mein peechay reh gaye aur main bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath peechay reh gaya. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) haajat se farigh hue to daryaft farmaya ke kya tumharay paas pani hai? Chunanche main pani ka aik lota le aaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne donon haath dhoye aur munh dhoya. Phir baazu aasteenon se nikalna chahay to aasteen tang ho gayi, yani na nikaal sakay. Chunanche Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne neechay se haath ko nikala aur jubba ko apne mondhon par daal diya aur donon haath dhoye aur peshani, amama aur mozon par masah kiya. Phir sawaar hue to main bhi sawaar hua. Jab apne logon mein pahunchay, to wo namaz padh rahay thay. Abdur Rahman bin Auf (raziyallahu anhu) un ko namaz padha rahay thay aur wo aik rakat padh chukay thay. Un ko jab maloom hua ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laaye hain, to wo peechay hatnay lagay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ishara farmaya ke apni jagah par raho. Phir unhon ne namaz padhayi. Jab salam phera to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay hue aur main bhi khara hua aur aik rakat jo ham se pehle ho chuki thi padh li. (Muslim: 1/159). Baab: Topi par masah. (Zail se murad daman hai; nasiya se murad peshani hai.)"
"141","[AI-translation] Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mozon aur amama par masah kiya. (Muslim: 1/159). Baab: Aik wuzu se namazein padhna."
"142","[AI-translation] Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Fatah Makka ke din aik wuzu se kai namazein padhein aur mozon par masah kiya. Umar Farooq (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne aaj wo kaam kiya jo kabhi nahi kiya tha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne qasdan aisa kiya hai. (Muslim: 1/160)"
"143","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham logon ko oont charanay ka kaam tha, meri baari aayi to main oonton ko chara kar shaam ko un ke rehnay ki jagah le kar aaya to main ne dekha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay hue logon ko waz suna rahay hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo Musalman achi tarah wuzu karay, phir khara ho kar do rakatein padhay, apne dil ko aur munh ko laga kar, yani zaahiran aur baatinan mutawajjah rahay, na dil mein duniya ka khayal laaye na munh idhar udhar phiraye, us ke liye jannat wajib ho jaye gi. Main ne kaha Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kya umda baat farmayi, jis ka sawab is qadar bara hai aur mehnat bohat kam hai. Us par aik kehnay wala mere saamnay keh raha tha ke pehli baat us se bhi umda thi. Main ne ghaur se dekha to wo Umar Farooq (raziyallahu anhu) thay. Unhon ne kaha ke main tujhe dekh raha tha ke tu abhi abhi aaya hai. Lihaza ye bhi sun le ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha ke jo koi tum mein se achi tarah, poora wuzu karay, phir kahay, tarjuma: Main gawahi deta hun ke koi ibadat ke laiq nahi siwae Allah ke aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke banday aur bhejay hue hain. To us ke liye jannat ke aathon darwazay khol diye jayein ge ke jis darwazay se chahay, jannat mein, daakhil ho jaye. (Muslim: 1/144). Baab: Mazi ka ghusl aur us se wuzu. (Rawwaha se murad shaam ko wapas laana hai; Muslim mein heen ka lafz nahi.)"
"144","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main zyada mazi wala aadmi tha aur main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochnay mein sharam ki kyunke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sahabzadi mere nikah mein thin, to main ne Miqdad bin Aswad (raziyallahu anhu) se, poochnay ko, kaha, unhon ne poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke apni sharmgah ko dho daalay aur wuzu karay. (Muslim: 1/169). Baab: Baith kar sonay se wuzu nahi toot-ta."
"145","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke, aik martaba, namaz ke liye iqamat kahi gayi aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik aadmi se sargoshi kar rahay thay. Abdul Waris ki hadees ke alfaaz hain ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik aadmi se sargoshi kar rahay thay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz ke liye kharay nahi hue hatta ke qaum, baithi baithi, so gayi. Aur Shuba ki riwayat mein hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sargoshi mein masroof rahay yahan tak ke sahaba, baithay baithay, so gaye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye aur unhein namaz padhayi, naya wuzu bananay ka hukm nahi diya. (Muslim: 1/195-196). Baab: Oont ke gosht se wuzu."
"146","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke kya main bakri ka gosht kha kar wuzu karun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke chahay to kar aur chahay to na kar. Phir us ne poocha ke oont ka gosht kha kar wuzu karun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya haan! Oont ka gosht khanay se wuzu kar. Us ne kaha ke kya bakriyon ke baaray mein namaz padhun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke haan. Us ne kaha ke oonton ke baaray mein namaz padhun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. (Muslim: 1/189)"
"147","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Ibrahim bin Qariz ne unhein is baat ki khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ko masjid mein wuzu kartay hue dekha. Unhon ne kaha ke main ne paneer ke tukray khaye hain is liye wuzu karta hun, kyunke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke us cheez ke khanay se wuzu karo jo aag par paki ho. (Muslim: 1/187). Baab: Aag par paki cheez se wuzu ka mansookh hona."
"148","[AI-translation] Jafar bin Amr bin Umayya Zamri apne walid Amr bin Umayya Zamri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke aik bakri ka shaana chhuri se kaat kar kha rahay thay. Itnay mein namaz ke liye bulaye gaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chhuri rakh di aur namaz padhi aur wuzu nahi kiya. (Muslim: 1/188)"
"149","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne doodh piya. Phir pani mangwaya aur kulli ki aur farmaya ke doodh se munh chikna ho jata hai. (Muslim: 1/188). Baab: Jo namaz mein khayal karay ke usay kuch hua hai."
"150","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ko, dauran-e-namaz, apne pait mein khalish maloom ho, phir us ko shak ho ke, pait se, kuch nikla ya nahi yani hawa kharij hui ya nahi to masjid se na niklay, jab tak ke aawaz na sunay ya boo na soonghay, yani hadas honay ka yaqeen na ho. (Muslim: 1/190)"
